Z||000008||Formula||09-17-2001||01:16 PM||||my daily driver is a 96 neon..<P>Wings West widemouth body kit, 17" silver 5 star wheels, alpine stereo, tinted windows, R/T style silver stripes on Black body, intake, exhaust, jet performance chip, lowered 1.5" all around, but I bought it that way for $2000 !! 60,000 miles..Future mods: Stage 2 hahns turbo system, 200-250 hp, comes with headers, and I'll probably put a 10" subwoofer in the trunk.<P>and the fiero's mods are 3.2 carbed stroker, ported and polished intake manifold, ported polished, shaved heads, C&Ced cylinders, bored 60 over, 3.1 crank (Stroker) high volume oil pump, windage tray, BIG cam, lifters that sound like they are making popcorn, best of everything.... Viper Red paint Job, aluminum split spoke 6 star wheels, Sony stereo, Grant steering wheel, custom interior (soon to be REALLY custom), sony sub, tinted windows, tailight covers, used to be clear but that got old. supposedly previous owner of the stroker said it dynoed at 270 hp.<BR>Future mods: custom new style dash, leather seats, new carpet, Ground Effects, Sunroof, hopefully the Aus-bodykit for christmas.<BR><P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>STROKE THIS!</FONT></FONT></B></I>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Flag.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Formulasiggy.jpg">    <BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>FORMULA</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||1
